{"title": "Channel, trend, hammer", "type": "Speed cheat sheet", "hooks": ["Three chart shapes in thirty seconds. Save this before your next trade.", "Three chart shapes in thirty seconds. Number two dropped 7 percent.", "A channel, a trend and a hammer, in thirty seconds."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Three chart shapes in thirty seconds. Save this before your next trade.", "text": "3 shapes. 30 seconds.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "1. Falling channel", "show": 90, "vo": "One: a falling channel. It closed below its trigger, so it completed, then failed before its target. A complete pattern still needs a stop.", "cues": [{"say": "a falling channel", "do": "shade", "from": 58, "to": 90, "tone": "red"}, {"say": "failed before its target", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 1, "head": "2. Downtrend", "show": 90, "vo": "Two: a downtrend. Lower highs and lower lows. The next twenty-five candles fell another 7 percent.", "cues": [{"say": "Lower highs", "do": "mark", "i": 85, "label": "LH", "side": "high", "tone": "red"}, {"say": "lower lows", "do": "mark", "i": 88, "label": "LL", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}, {"say": "fell another 7 percent", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 2, "head": "3. Hammer", "show": 90, "vo": "Three: a hammer. A long lower wick after a fall. Sellers pushed down, buyers pushed back. Ten candles later, 2.1 percent higher.", "cues": [{"say": "a hammer", "do": "mark", "i": 90, "label": "3", "side": "low", "tone": "green"}, {"say": "Ten candles later", "do": "reveal", "to": 100}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "A clue, never a promise", "vo": "Each one is a clue, never a promise. They mean most at a level that matters.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Save this cheat sheet", "vo": "Save this, and practise spotting them at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Three chart shapes in thirty seconds.\n\nFal